B.rL=new A.bt(B.rV,["Soko Vibe \u2014 Nunua na Uza Bidhaa Tanzania","Soko","Jinsi Inavyofanya Kazi","Usalama","Kwa Wauzaji","Maswali","Tafuta bidhaa","Anza Kuuza","Fungua menyu","Funga menyu","Lugha","Soko la Tanzania \xb7 Malipo ya escrow","Nunua kwa uhakika.","Uza kwa ujasiri.","Soko Vibe ni soko la Tanzania la kununua na kuuza bidhaa kwa urahisi, huku malipo yakilindwa kwa escrow mpaka uthibitishe kupokea bidhaa yako.","Anza Kununua","Anza Kuuza","Tazama Bidhaa","Tafuta simu, viatu, samani\u2026","Muuzaji aliyehakikiwa","Escrow inalinda malipo","Usafirishaji nchi nzima","Imetengenezwa kwa wanunuzi na wauzaji wa Tanzania.","Soko","Bidhaa unazotafuta, sehemu moja.","Mifano ya jinsi bidhaa zinavyoonekana sokoni \u2014 na muuzaji aliyehakikiwa na bei wazi.","Mfano","Aliyehakikiwa","Boost","Usafirishaji","Kwa nini Soko Vibe?","Ununuzi unaanza kwa kuamini.","Kila hatua ya muamala imejengwa kukulinda \u2014 kuanzia unapoona bidhaa hadi unapoipokea.","Escrow inalinda pesa","Fedha zinashikiliwa na ClickPesa hadi uthibitishe kupokea bidhaa. Mgogoro ukitokea, timu inashughulikia.","Wauzaji waliohakikiwa","Wauzaji huthibitisha utambulisho (KYC) kabla ya kuuza.","Mazungumzo salama","Ongea na muuzaji ndani ya app kabla ya kuamua \u2014 maswali, picha na majadiliano ya bei.","Mobile money","Lipa kwa M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, Airtel Money, HaloPesa au EzyPesa.","Uthibitisho wa OTP","Unathibitisha kupokea kwa OTP \u2014 ndipo muuzaji analipwa.","Utafutaji wa AI","Tafuta kwa kuandika au kwa sauti; msaidizi anakusaidia kupata unachohitaji.","Fedha zako hazitoki mpaka upokee.","Huu ndio mzunguko wa kila malipo \u2014 wazi, unaofuatiliwa, na salama kwa pande zote mbili.","Mnunuzi analipa","Escrow inashikilia","Muuzaji anatuma","Mnunuzi anapokea","Mnunuzi anathibitisha","Muuzaji analipwa","Kwa wanunuzi","Kila kitu unachohitaji kununua kwa amani.","Tafuta na linganisha bidhaa","Ongea na muuzaji moja kwa moja","Lipa kwa usalama kupitia escrow","Fuatilia oda yako","Thibitisha kupokea kwa OTP","Kwa wauzaji","Duka lako, dashboard yenye nguvu.","Weka bidhaa bure, simamia oda, ongea na wateja na ukuze mauzo.","Orodha za bidhaa bila gharama","Takwimu za mauzo kwa wakati","Boost bidhaa kwa bei nafuu","Uthibitisho wa muuzaji (KYC)","Usimamizi wa oda na pochi","Mfano wa takwimu","J1","J2","J3","J4","J5","J6","J7","Teknolojia","Tafuta unachotaka kwa njia rahisi.","Andika kama unavyoongea \u2014 au bonyeza kipaza sauti.","natafuta simu nzuri chini ya TSh 500,000","Mfano wa onesho","Tafuta kwa sauti","Usafirishaji","Unaona kila hatua ya kifurushi chako.","Oda imewekwa","Malipo yanaingia escrow mara moja.","Muuzaji anaandaa","Bidhaa inafungwa na kukabidhiwa msafirishaji.","Njiani","Unafuatilia usafirishaji nchi nzima.","Inakaribia","Unajulishwa kifurushi kinapowasili.","Imepokelewa","Unathibitisha kwa OTP \u2014 muuzaji analipwa.","Ukuaji wa muuzaji","Unataka bidhaa yako ionekane zaidi?","Kuweka orodha ni bure kila wakati. Unalipa tu unapochagua kupandisha.","Mwonekano wa haraka","Wiki nzima ya mwonekano","Ufikiaji mkubwa, mwezi mzima","kwa orodha moja","siku 3","siku 7","siku 30","Maarufu","Pandisha kwenye app","Bei zote ni shilingi za Tanzania. Boost unafanya ndani ya app.","Usalama","Tulivu, wazi, salama.","Escrow na ClickPesa","Fedha zinashikiliwa hadi ununuzi uthibitike.","KYC ya wauzaji","Utambulisho unahakikiwa kabla ya kuuza.","Mchakato wa malalamiko","Mgogoro ukitokea kuna njia rasmi ya kutatua.","Faragha ya data","Tunafuata Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Data ya Tanzania, 2022.","App","Soko lote mfukoni mwako.","App ya Android inapatikana sasa kupitia WhatsApp. Tutumie ujumbe tukupatie link rasmi.","Pata Soko Vibe","Google Play \u2014 Inapatikana hivi karibuni","Maswali","Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","Je, kuweka bidhaa ni bure?","Ndiyo. Kufungua orodha haina gharama. Unalipa tu unapochagua ku-boost.","Fedha zangu zinalindwaje?","Malipo yanaingia escrow kupitia ClickPesa na yanatolewa kwa muuzaji tu baada ya wewe kuthibitisha kupokea.","Naweza kuzungumza na muuzaji?","Ndiyo \u2014 kila orodha ina mazungumzo ya ndani ya app kabla ya kununua.","Usafirishaji unafanyaje kazi?","Wauzaji hupanga usafirishaji nchi nzima; unathibitisha kupokea kwa OTP.","Kuna ada gani?","Ada ya jukwaa ya 3.5% kwa mnunuzi wakati wa ununuzi. Muuzaji anapokea bei kamili. Hakuna ada ya orodha.","Ninawezaje kupata app?","Tutumie ujumbe WhatsApp +255 693 273 241 na tutakupatia link rasmi ya Android.","Karibu kwenye soko linalofuata la Tanzania.","Nunua kwa uhakika. Uza kwa ujasiri.","Anza na Soko Vibe","Soko la Tanzania la kununua na kuuza kwa usalama.","Soko Vibe","Kategoria","Jinsi Inavyofanya Kazi","Usalama","Ada","Maswali","Kwa Wauzaji","Anza Kuuza","Zana za Muuzaji","Boost","Uthibitisho","Sheria","Privacy","Terms","Security","Mawasiliano","Haki zote zimehifadhiwa."],t.li)
