B.Jh=new A.bt(B.rV,["Soko Vibe \u2014 Buy and Sell Products in Tanzania","Market","How It Works","Security","For Sellers","FAQ","Search products","Start Selling","Open menu","Close menu","Language","Tanzanian market \xb7 Escrow payments","Buy with confidence.","Sell with courage.","Soko Vibe is the Tanzanian market for buying and selling products with ease, while payments stay protected in escrow until you confirm receipt.","Start Buying","Start Selling","Browse Products","Search phones, shoes, furniture\u2026","Verified seller","Escrow protects payment","Nationwide delivery","Built for Tanzanian buyers and sellers.","Market","What you are looking for, in one place.","Sample of how products appear in the market \u2014 with verified sellers and clear prices.","Sample","Verified","Boost","Delivery","Why Soko Vibe?","Buying starts with trust.","Every step of the transaction is built to protect you \u2014 from discovery to doorstep.","Escrow-protected money","Funds are held by ClickPesa until you confirm receipt. If a dispute arises, the team steps in.","Verified sellers","Sellers verify identity (KYC) before selling.","Secure chat","Talk to the seller in-app before deciding \u2014 questions, photos, price talk.","Mobile money","Pay with M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, Airtel Money, HaloPesa or EzyPesa.","OTP confirmation","You confirm receipt with an OTP \u2014 only then is the seller paid.","AI search","Search by typing or voice; the assistant helps you find what you need.","Your money never moves until you receive.","This is the journey of every payment \u2014 open, trackable, and safe for both sides.","Buyer pays","Escrow holds","Seller ships","Buyer receives","Buyer confirms","Seller is paid","For buyers","Everything you need to buy in peace.","Find and compare products","Chat directly with sellers","Pay securely via escrow","Track your order","Confirm delivery with OTP","For sellers","Your shop, a powerful dashboard.","List for free, manage orders, talk to customers and grow sales.","Free product listings","Real-time sales stats","Affordable product boosts","Seller verification (KYC)","Orders and wallet management","Sample stats","W1","W2","W3","W4","W5","W6","W7","Technology","Find what you want, the easy way.","Write like you speak \u2014 or tap the microphone.","looking for a good phone under TSh 500,000","Demo illustration","Voice search","Delivery","See every step of your parcel.","Order placed","Payment enters escrow immediately.","Seller prepares","The product is packed and handed to the courier.","In transit","You follow delivery across the country.","Arriving","You are notified as the parcel arrives.","Delivered","You confirm with OTP \u2014 the seller is paid.","Seller growth","Want your product seen more?","Listing is always free. You only pay when you choose to boost.","Quick visibility","A full week of visibility","Maximum reach, all month","per listing","3 days","7 days","30 days","Popular","Boost in the app","All prices are Tanzanian shillings. Boosting happens inside the app.","Security","Calm, open, secure.","Escrow & ClickPesa","Funds are held until the purchase is confirmed.","Seller KYC","Identity is verified before selling.","Complaints process","If a dispute arises there is a formal resolution path.","Data privacy","We follow the Tanzania Data Protection Act, 2022.","App","The whole market in your pocket.","The Android app is available now via WhatsApp. Message us and we will send the official link.","Get Soko Vibe","Google Play \u2014 Coming soon","FAQ","Frequently asked questions","Is listing products free?","Yes. Opening a listing costs nothing. You only pay when you choose to boost.","How is my money protected?","Payments enter escrow via ClickPesa and reach the seller only after you confirm receipt.","Can I talk to the seller?","Yes \u2014 every listing has in-app chat before you buy.","How does delivery work?","Sellers arrange nationwide delivery; you confirm receipt with OTP.","What fees exist?","A 3.5% platform fee for the buyer at checkout. The seller receives the full price. No listing fees.","How do I get the app?","Message us on WhatsApp at +255 693 273 241 for the official Android link.","Welcome to the next Tanzanian market.","Buy with confidence. Sell with courage.","Start with Soko Vibe","The Tanzanian market for safe buying and selling.","Soko Vibe","Categories","How It Works","Security","Fees","FAQ","For Sellers","Start Selling","Seller Tools","Boost","Verification","Legal","Privacy","Terms","Security","Contact","All rights reserved."],t.li)
